For each doctor, display their id, full name, and the first and last admission date they attended.

Query
SELECT
d.doctor_id, concat(d.first_name, " ", d.last_name), min(a.admission_date) as first_admission
, Max(a.admission_date) as last_admission
from doctors d 
left join
admissions a on d.doctor_id = a.attending_doctor_id
group by (a.attending_doctor_id);
